/* 真人支持性复核步骤（Figma 659:2120 等 8 帧）：竹节进度 → 衬线标题 → 纸白步骤卡 → 上一步/继续 → 边界说明。 */
:host {
  display: block;
}

.taf-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.taf-progress {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.taf-progress__text {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.taf-progress__joints {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8rpx;
}

.taf-progress__joint {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 12rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--p3-primary);
  opacity: 0.14;
}

.taf-progress__joint--done {
  opacity: 0.55;
}

.taf-progress__joint--current {
  opacity: 1;
}

.taf-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  padding: var(--p3-card);
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-card);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.taf-description {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.taf-options {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.taf-status {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

/* 小行动表单：三段“想做什么 / 怎样安排 / 何时停下”，后两段上方细线 */
.taf-action-form {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.taf-action-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding-top: 8rpx;
}

.taf-action-section--divided {
  padding-top: 32rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx solid var(--p3-hairline);
}

.taf-action-grid {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.taf-action-grid__item {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
}

/* 选择器字段（Figma P3/Field Select）：右侧日历或下拉图标 */
.taf-select {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 96rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 28rpx;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  background: var(--p3-surface);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2rpx var(--p3-control);
}

.taf-select__value {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
}

.taf-select__value--empty {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
}

.taf-select__icon {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

/* 自愿确认（Figma P3/Agreement）：20px 方框，勾选后青瓷实心 + 白勾 */
.taf-confirmation {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 20rpx;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  padding: 20rpx 0;
  text-align: left;
}

.taf-confirmation__box {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 40rpx;
  height: 40rpx;
  margin-top: 2rpx;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: var(--p3-surface);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3rpx var(--p3-control);
}

.taf-confirmation__box--checked {
  background: var(--p3-primary);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3rpx var(--p3-primary);
}

.taf-confirmation__tick {
  width: 28rpx;
  height: 28rpx;
}

.taf-confirmation__text {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.taf-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.taf-actions__back {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: auto;
  padding: 0 56rpx;
}

.taf-actions__next {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
}
